Subject: [PATCH 34/38] kebab: XNU-003 pass args="pause" to the test payload

The payload ran but printed and returned immediately, so UniXNU repainted
the menu before anything could be read. HelloPayload already accepts a
'pause' load option that stalls 15 s after printing its report, so the
config now passes args = "pause" and UniXNU hands it over as
Loaded->LoadOptions (Boot.c:195).
